From: Darshan Hegde <96007698+DarshanHegde15@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:14:20 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] FeatureGate: on/off switch via Settings.Global (off by
 default)

FEATURE_GATE_ENABLED is read at boot phase 500 and observed with a
ContentObserver. When off, the service is dormant: every feature is
allowed (enforcers lift all blocks through the normal diff path),
rule changes and listener registration are refused with
ERROR_SERVICE_DISABLED (IllegalStateException in the manager), and
saved rules are kept for when it is switched back on.

Change-Id: I7a970b700d82024e296b03af603025dd0e050879
